# Backend Auto-Changelog

When you edit ANY file under `y_fi_backend/`, automatically before your final response:

1. Prepend to `y_fi_backend/.cursor/workflow/changelog.md` with timestamp `YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM (UTC+6)`
2. Update `api-reference.md` if endpoints changed
3. Update `database-flow.md` if models/migrations changed
4. Update `business-logic.md` if formulas/constants changed

Do not wait for the user to say "update changelog". This is mandatory on every code-changing turn.
